### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health/

### Get notes
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/notes/

### Get flashcards
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/flashcards/

### Get progress
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/progress/

### Complete review
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/review/complete/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 4,
  "total_questions": 5,
  "xp_earned": 125
}

### New Note
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/notes/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Django REST Framework",
    "content": "DRF helps Django expose data through API endpoints.",
    "tag": "Programming"
}